## Acceptance Authority

Later approved decisions override the acceptance criteria in the design and the phase plan: the roadmap's out-of-scope list, the user's recorded answers, and the Per-Phase Implementation Review decisions file. Where one of them conflicts with an acceptance criterion, judge against the later decision. Do not raise again a finding the decisions file records as accepted as is.

Roadmap: /state/feat-x/run-1/roadmap/plan.md

Per-Phase Implementation Review decisions: /state/feat-x/run-1/phase-02/implement/review-decisions.md

